  "title": "Healthy Heros",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"post-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2012-02-06\" class=\"post-date entry-date updated\">February 6, 2012</time>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"post-title entry-title\"><a href=\"/healthy-heros\">Healthy Heros</a></h1>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post-author\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/author/kathy\" rel=\"author\">kathy</a></span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post-category\"><a href=\"/category/main\" rel=\"category tag\">main</a></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\n        \t\t\t\t<h4>George Attla<em> </em>on Exercise</h4>\n<p>A vow to never get out of shape sums up George Attla’s commitment to exercise. A childhood illness taught him that there are ways to stay in shape, even when confined to a hospital bed. Today he still moves 5-gallon buckets to feed his dogs. In winter he cuts and hauls his own firewood, shovels snow, travels by snow machine, and traps beaver under the ice. In summer he sets nets to catch salmon.</p>\n<h3><div id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-339 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/images/attla/2012/02/Screen-shot-2012-05-28-at-8.35.31-AM.png\"><img src=\"/images/attla/2012/02/Screen-shot-2012-05-28-at-8.35.31-AM.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail attla-content-img\" alt=\"Healthy Heros\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1893\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-1-1893\">\n\t\t\t\tAlaska Sports Hall of Fame Healthy Heros \n\t\t\t\t</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/images/attla/2012/02/Screen-shot-2012-05-28-at-8.35.41-AM.png\"><img src=\"/images/attla/2012/02/Screen-shot-2012-05-28-at-8.35.41-AM.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail attla-content-img\" alt=\"Healthy Heros\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1892\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-1-1892\">\n\t\t\t\tHealthy Heros on Excercise by George Attla\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption></figure>\n\t\t</div>\n</h3>\n<p>View larger version of <a href=\"/images/attla/2012/02/Healthy-heros.png\" target=\"_blank\">Healthy Heros On Exercise, by George Attla</a></p>\n<!--themify_builder_content-->\n<div id=\"themify_builder_content-339\" data-postid=\"339\" class=\"themify_builder_content themify_builder_content-339 themify_builder tf_clear\">\n    </div>\n<!--/themify_builder_content-->\n\n\t    \n\t</div><!-- /.entry-content -->\n\t\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /.post-content -->"
